<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Nieves Pérez Alonso | Data Analyst & BI</title>
    <!-- Font Awesome -->
    <script src="https://kit.fontawesome.com/2898a0ac51.js" crossorigin="anonymous"></script>
    <!-- Google Fonts -->
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inconsolata:wght@400;700&family=Lato:wght@400;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        :root {
            --primary: #0f705d;
            --primary-hover: #148a74;
            --bg-dark: #020502;
            --card-bg: #0a0a0a;
            --text-main: #ffffff;
            --text-dim: #d1d1d1;
            --text-muted: #666666;
            --font-mono: 'Inconsolata', monospace;
            --font-sans: 'Lato', sans-serif;
        }

        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }

        html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }

        body {
            background-color: var(--bg-dark);
            color: var(--text-main);
            font-family: var(--font-sans);
            line-height: 1.6;
            overflow-x: hidden;
        }

        /* --- HEADER --- */
        header {
            position: fixed;
            top: 0;
            width: 100%;
            padding: 15px 40px;
            background: rgba(2, 5, 2, 0.9);
            backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
            z-index: 1000;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(15, 112, 93, 0.2);
        }

        .logo {
            font-family: var(--font-mono);
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--primary);
            text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
        }

        nav ul {
            display: flex;
            list-style: none;
            gap: 25px;
        }

        nav a {
            text-decoration: none;
            color: var(--text-dim);
            font-family: var(--font-mono);
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            transition: 0.3s;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }

        nav a:hover { color: var(--primary); }

        /* --- MAIN CONTENT --- */
        main {
            max-width: 1100px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 0 20px;
        }

        section { padding: 100px 0 40px 0; }

        .section-title {
            font-family: var(--font-mono);
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
            color: var(--primary);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 15px;
        }

        .section-title::after {
            content: "";
            height: 1px;
            background: rgba(15, 112, 93, 0.3);
            flex-grow: 1;
        }

        /* --- HERO --- */
        .hero {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            min-height: 85vh;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 40px;
        }

        .hero-title {
            font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.5rem);
            line-height: 1.1;
            margin: 15px 0 25px 0;
            font-weight: 800;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        .btn-primary {
            background-color: var(--primary);
            color: white;
            padding: 12px 30px;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 700;
            border-radius: 4px;
            transition: 0.3s;
            font-family: var(--font-mono);
        }

        /* --- SOBRE MÍ --- */
        .about-content {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 50px;
            align-items: start;
        }

        .about-text p { margin-bottom: 20px; color: var(--text-dim); }

        /* --- SKILLS --- */
        .skills-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(100px, 1fr));
            gap: 20px;
        }

        .skill-card {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            padding: 15px;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
            border: 1px solid rgba(15, 112, 93, 0.1);
            border-radius: 8px;
            transition: 0.3s;
        }

        .skill-card:hover { border-color: var(--primary); transform: translateY(-3px); }

        .green-filter {
            filter: invert(33%) sepia(80%) saturate(450%) hue-rotate(125deg) brightness(95%) contrast(90%);
            width: 30px; height: 30px;
        }

        /* --- ESTUDIOS --- */
        .education-item {
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            padding-left: 20px;
            border-left: 2px solid var(--primary);
        }

        .edu-date { font-family: var(--font-mono); color: var(--primary); font-size: 0.9rem; }
        .edu-title { font-size: 1.2rem; font-weight: 700; margin: 5px 0; }
        .edu-inst { color: var(--text-muted); font-style: italic; margin-bottom: 10px; }

        /* --- FOOTER --- */
        footer {
            margin-top: 80px;
            padding: 40px 20px;
            background: #050805;
            border-top: 1px solid rgba(15, 112, 93, 0.1);
            text-align: center;
        }

        .footer-socials { display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 25px; margin-bottom: 20px; }
        .footer-socials a { color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 1.3rem; transition: 0.3s; }
        .footer-socials a:hover { color: var(--primary); }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .about-content { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
            header { flex-direction: column; padding: 15px; }
            nav ul { gap: 10px; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <header>
        <a href="#" class="logo">&lt;NIEVES.DATA /&gt;</a>
        <nav>
            <ul>
                <li><a href="#inicio">Inicio</a></li>
                <li><a href="#sobremi">Sobre mí</a></li>
                <li><a href="#habilidades">Habilidades</a></li>
                <li><a href="#proyectos">Proyectos</a></li>
                <li><a href="#estudios">Estudios</a></li>
            </ul>
        </nav>
    </header>

    <main>
        <!-- SECCIÓN HERO -->
        <section id="inicio" class="hero">
            <div class="hero-content">
                <span style="color: var(--primary); font-family: var(--font-mono); font-weight: 700;">&lt; DATA_STRATEGY /&gt;</span>
                <h1 class="hero-title">NIEVES PÉREZ ALONSO<br/> <span style="color: var(--primary); font-size: 0.8em;">DATA ANALYST | BI</span></h1>
                <p style="color: var(--text-dim); max-width: 550px; font-size: 1.1rem; margin-bottom: 30px;">
                    Transformando datos de Retail en decisiones estratégicas. Más de 6 años de experiencia operativa optimizando flujos de negocio.
                </p>
                <a href="mailto:nievesperezalonso@gmail.com" class="btn-primary">CONTACTAR</a>
            </div>
            
            <div style="flex: 1; display: flex; justify-content: center;">
                <div style="width: 260px; height: 260px; border-radius: 50%; border: 1px solid var(--primary); padding: 10px; background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(15,112,93,0.1), transparent);">
                    <div style="width: 100%; height: 100%; border-radius: 50%; background: #0a0a0a; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; overflow: hidden;">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-user-tie" style="font-size: 6rem; color: #1a1a1a;"></i>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- SECCIÓN SOBRE MÍ -->
        <section id="sobremi">
            <h2 class="section-title">Sobre mí</h2>
            <div class="about-content">
                <div class="about-text">
                    <p>Soy una analista de datos con una sólida base operativa en el sector <strong>Retail</strong>. Mi trayectoria de más de 6 años en <strong>Inditex (Oysho)</strong> me ha permitido desarrollar una visión única sobre cómo los datos impactan directamente en la rentabilidad y la eficiencia de la cadena de suministro.</p>
                    <p>Mi enfoque une la precisión técnica del análisis de datos con una profunda comprensión del comportamiento del consumidor, permitiéndome optimizar inventarios y estrategias de venta mediante modelos predictivos y visualizaciones claras.</p>
                </div>
                <div style="background: rgba(15,112,93,0.05); padding: 30px; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid rgba(15,112,93,0.1);">
                    <h4 style="color: var(--primary); margin-bottom: 15px; font-family: var(--font-mono);">_ Highlights</h4>
                    <ul style="list-style: none; color: var(--text-dim); font-size: 0.9rem;">
                        <li style="margin-bottom: 10px;"><i class="fa-solid fa-check" style="color: var(--primary); margin-right: 10px;"></i> Especialista en KPIs de Retail</li>
                        <li style="margin-bottom: 10px;"><i class="fa-solid fa-check" style="color: var(--primary); margin-right: 10px;"></i> Experta en Limpieza de Datasets</li>
                        <li><i class="fa-solid fa-check" style="color: var(--primary); margin-right: 10px;"></i> Storytelling con Visualización de Datos</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- SECCIÓN HABILIDADES -->
        <section id="habilidades">
            <h2 class="section-title">Stack Tecnológico</h2>
            <div class="skills-grid">
                <div class="skill-card"><div class="icon-box"><i class="fa-brands fa-python"></i></div><span class="skill-name" style="font-size:0.7rem;">Python</span></div>
                <div class="skill-card"><div class="icon-box"><img src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/devicons/devicon/icons/mysql/mysql-original.svg" class="green-filter"></div><span class="skill-name" style="font-size:0.7rem;">MySQL</span></div>
                <div class="skill-card"><div class="icon-box"><img src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/devicons/devicon/icons/pandas/pandas-original.svg" class="green-filter"></div><span class="skill-name" style="font-size:0.7rem;">Pandas</span></div>
                <div class="skill-card"><div class="icon-box"><i class="fa-solid fa-network-wired"></i></div><span class="skill-name" style="font-size:0.7rem;">Scraping</span></div>
                <div class="skill-card">
                    <div class="icon-box"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="25" height="25" fill="var(--primary)"><path d="M12 2C8.69 2 6 4.69 6 8C6 10.36 7.37 12.41 9.38 13.38L9 22H15L14.62 13.38C16.63 12.41 18 10.36 18 8C18 4.69 15.31 2 12 2ZM13.5 9H10.5V7H13.5V9Z"/></svg></div>
                    <span class="skill-name" style="font-size:0.7rem;">Ollama IA</span>
                </div>
                <div class="skill-card"><div class="icon-box"><i class="fa-solid fa-chart-pie"></i></div><span class="skill-name" style="font-size:0.7rem;">Tableau</span></div>
                <div class="skill-card"><div class="icon-box"><i class="fa-solid fa-chart-column"></i></div><span class="skill-name" style="font-size:0.7rem;">Power BI</span></div>
                <div class="skill-card"><div class="icon-box"><img src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/devicons/devicon/icons/vscode/vscode-original.svg" class="green-filter"></div><span class="skill-name" style="font-size:0.7rem;">VS Code</span></div>
                <div class="skill-card"><div class="icon-box"><i class="fa-brands fa-git-alt"></i></div><span class="skill-name" style="font-size:0.7rem;">Git</span></div>
                <div class="skill-card"><div class="icon-box"><i class="fa-regular fa-file-excel"></i></div><span class="skill-name" style="font-size:0.7rem;">Excel</span></div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- SECCIÓN ESTUDIOS (ACTUALIZADA) -->
        <section id="estudios">
            <h2 class="section-title">Formación Académica</h2>
            
            <div class="education-item">
                <span class="edu-date">2024 - 2025</span>
                <h3 class="edu-title">BOOTCAMP DATA ANALYTICS & IA</h3>
                <p class="edu-inst">Adalab</p>
                <p style="color: var(--text-dim); font-size: 0.9rem;">Formación intensiva en el ecosistema de datos: Python, SQL, visualización avanzada y aplicación de IA generativa en procesos de análisis.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="education-item">
                <span class="edu-date">2016 - 2017</span>
                <h3 class="edu-title">MÁSTER EN EDUCACIÓN ARTÍSTICA</h3>
                <p class="edu-inst">Universidad Complutense de Madrid (UCM)</p>
                <p style="color: var(--text-dim); font-size: 0.9rem;">Investigación aplicada y gestión en instituciones culturales.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="education-item">
                <span class="edu-date">2009 - 2014</span>
                <h3 class="edu-title">GRADO EN HISTORIA DEL ARTE</h3>
                <p class="edu-inst">Universidad Autónoma de Madrid (UAM)</p>
                <p style="color: var(--text-dim); font-size: 0.9rem;">Desarrollo de pensamiento crítico y análisis visual de estructuras complejas.</p>
            </div>
        </section>
    </main>

    <footer>
        <div class="footer-socials">
            <a href="https://github.com/NievesPerez-Data"><i class="fa-brands fa-github"></i></a>
            <a href="https://linkedin.com/in/nievesperezalonso"><i class="fa-brands fa-linkedin"></i></a>
            <a href="mailto:nievesperezalonso@gmail.com"><i class="fa-solid fa-envelope"></i></a>
        </div>
        <p class="copyright">NIEVES PÉREZ ALONSO // DATA ANALYST // 2026</p>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
